# Model of the object called cube, used by the model-based tracker (vpMbGenericTracker).
# The cube has 0.085 m edges, and is centered on the origin of the object frame.
# Coordinates are in meters: X, Y and Z in [-0.0425, 0.0425]. The object frame is the same as the one of the RBT
# model config/rbt/models/cube/cube.obj, so that both trackers use the same initialization points (cube.init).
V1
# 3D Points
8                  # Number of points
-0.0425 -0.0425 -0.0425 # Point 0: X Y Z
 0.0425 -0.0425 -0.0425
 0.0425 -0.0425  0.0425
-0.0425 -0.0425  0.0425
-0.0425  0.0425  0.0425
 0.0425  0.0425  0.0425
 0.0425  0.0425 -0.0425
-0.0425  0.0425 -0.0425 # Point 7
# 3D Lines
0                  # Number of lines
# Faces from 3D lines
0                  # Number of faces
# Faces from 3D points
6                  # Number of faces
4 0 1 2 3          # Face 0: [number of points] [index of the 3D points]...
4 7 4 5 6
4 4 3 2 5
4 6 1 0 7
4 7 0 3 4
4 5 2 1 6          # Face 5
# 3D cylinders
0                  # Number of cylinders
# 3D circles
0                  # Number of circles
